.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH optimize 1  "optimize " 
.SH NAME
optimize \- Heavy offline snapshot layout optimizer (RCM graph reordering, vector encodings, section stripping)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBoptimize\fR <\fB\-i\fR|\fB\-\-input\fR> <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR> [\fB\-\-rcm\fR] [\fB\-\-encoding\fR] [\fB\-\-strip\-mappings\fR] [\fB\-\-strip\-properties\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Heavy offline snapshot layout optimizer (RCM graph reordering, vector encodings, section stripping)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-i\fR, \fB\-\-input\fR \fI<INPUT>\fR
Input binary snapshot (.imps)
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Output optimized snapshot destination (.imps)
.TP
\fB\-\-rcm\fR
Apply Reverse Cuthill\-McKee (RCM) bandwidth reduction and cache\-line reordering
.TP
\fB\-\-encoding\fR \fI<ENCODING>\fR
Target CSR column encoding (raw_uint32, delta_vbyte, simdcomp, sliced_ellpack)
.TP
\fB\-\-strip\-mappings\fR
Strip string ID mapping catalog for minimal runtime binary footprint
.TP
\fB\-\-strip\-properties\fR
Strip DTO property payload blocks
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
